# Build context of the app images (apps/api/Dockerfile, deploy/web/Dockerfile), repository
# root. Allowlist: only what the builds read gets in, so .env files, local databases, bank
# files and the data track never reach an image. data/ builds with its own context.
*
!package.json
!pnpm-lock.yaml
!pnpm-workspace.yaml
!tsconfig.base.json
!packages/shared
!apps/api
!apps/web
!deploy/web
!deploy/scripts

# Never, even inside the allowed folders.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/dist-demo
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.log
**/coverage
